# PIP-MON .gitignore
#
# Written BEFORE the first commit, deliberately. The rule this encodes:
#   a build gate that regenerates a derived artefact must never be able to
#   commit that artefact by accident, because then a stale copy can be
#   reviewed and merged as though it were source.
#
# Everything excluded here is either (a) regenerated by build_all.bat, or
# (b) vendored from elsewhere and already has its own upstream.

# --- build outputs ---------------------------------------------------------
build/
vprobe/build/
launcher/build/
overseer_cli/build/
dist/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.exe
*.dll

# --- staging: a deployment staging area, not source -----------------------
# Holds copies of the runtime and the database laid out as they are installed.
stage/

# --- generated database artefacts ------------------------------------------
# vprobe/libs/fo4_*.addresses.txt is the PER-BUILD SOURCE and IS tracked: it is
# the database every build derives from and byte-compares against.
#
# The .bin next to it is NOT tracked, for two reasons. It is derived, and
# vprobe/build_libbin.bat regenerates and byte-compares it on every build, so
# committing it would let a stale copy be reviewed as though it were source.
# And it is MACHINE-SPECIFIC: its header carries an FNV-1a hash of the local
# Fallout4.exe's PE headers, so one committed copy would be wrong for every
# other install. Each machine generates its own from the same .txt.
vprobe/libs/*.addresses.bin
vprobe/libs/deploy/

# --- generated Papyrus bytecode --------------------------------------------
# Produced from PipMon.psc by build_papyrus.bat, which verifies the PEX magic.
# Tracked source is the .psc, not the compiled artefact.
*.pex
*.asm

# --- vendored third-party --------------------------------------------------
# third_party/CommonLibF4 is a full .git clone of a third-party repository
# (19.5 MB). It carries its own history and must never be flattened into ours.
# Our use of it is documented, and it is data-only: nothing links against it.
third_party/

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --- rust ------------------------------------------------------------------
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# --- editor / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- logs and crash dumps --------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.dmp
crash.log
Papyrus.0.log

# --- local scratch ---------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.tmp
